sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant V as PhotoScanView
  participant P as PhotoPresenter
  participant S as PhotoSessionService
  participant B as ScannerBackend
  participant D as PhotoDetector
  participant E as ImageEncoder
  U->>V: place photos, press Scan
  V->>P: on_scan()
  P->>S: scan_batch()
  S->>B: scan(Flatbed, Color, 600 dpi, full area)
  B-->>S: raw image (worker thread, progress signals)
  S->>D: detect(raw)
  D-->>S: CropRegions (angle, box)
  S-->>P: proposal
  P-->>V: show overlay boxes
  U->>V: correct boxes, rotate, Accept
  V->>P: on_accept(regions)
  P->>S: save(regions)
  loop each region
    S->>S: deskew + crop (lossless in memory)
    S->>E: encode(photo, album/NNNN.png)
  end
  S-->>P: saved n photos
  P-->>V: ask "Next photos or Done?"
